     "src": "/images/013a6e5d76705e9c.png",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 416,
     "h": 416
    },
    {
     "tag": "p",
     "text": "Mistral AI is a pioneering company specializing in advanced artificial intelligence solutions tailored to various industries. Leveraging cutting-edge AI models and algorithms, Mistral AI offers custom solutions designed to meet the unique needs of businesses. Their expertise spans machine learning, deep learning, and other AI technologies, enabling tasks such as image recognition, natural language processing, and recommendation systems. Through consulting services, Mistral AI assists clients in formulating effective AI strategies and integrating AI solutions into their existing infrastructure. With a focus on research and development, Mistral AI stays at the forefront of AI innovation, continuously exploring new algorithms and technologies to address emerging challenges across sectors such as healthcare, finance, retail, and manufacturing.",
     "href": "",
     "src": "",
     "alt": "",
     "size": "16px",
     "color": "rgb(33, 33, 33)"
    },
    {
